.TH std::experimental::reflect::MemberFunction 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::experimental::reflect::MemberFunction \- std::experimental::reflect::MemberFunction

.SH Synopsis
Defined in header <experimental/reflect>
template< class T >
concept MemberFunction = RecordMember<T> && Function<T> && /* see below    (reflection TS)
*/;

The MemberFunction concept is satisfied if and only if T reflects a member function,
excluding constructors and destructors.

